1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,390
Five things you must never do in Eswatini.

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:03,944
Don't drive at night.

3
00:00:03,964 --> 00:00:08,102
Cattle wander onto dark roads, and armed
carjackings have hit main routes.

4
00:00:08,502 --> 00:00:10,587
Don't ride the khumbi minibus taxis.

5
00:00:10,607 --> 00:00:13,413
They are often poorly maintained and
overloaded.

6
00:00:13,813 --> 00:00:16,192
Don't join protests, even peaceful ones.

7
00:00:16,212 --> 00:00:20,171
Security forces have used force, and some
protests turned violent.

8
00:00:20,571 --> 00:00:24,117
Don't photograph royal residences,
soldiers, or government buildings.

9
00:00:24,137 --> 00:00:25,997
It is prohibited without permission.

10
00:00:26,397 --> 00:00:27,650
Don't insult the king.

11
00:00:27,670 --> 00:00:31,816
Offensive words or actions toward the
royal family can bring prosecution

12
00:00:31,836 --> 00:00:33,109
and long prison terms.

